flowchart TB
    accTitle: Project development process
    accDescr: Rachel and Grace agreed on the cooking use case and service contracts. They built the backend and frontend in parallel, then integrated and tested their work. Presentation and final delivery are planned milestones.
    subgraph engineering["Design and implementation"]
        direction LR
        scope["Define the cooking use case<br/>and choose the MVP"]
        contract["Agree on data, permissions<br/>and service contracts"]
        back["Rachel · backend<br/>Prisma, auth, photos, scaling math"]
        front["Grace · frontend<br/>Recipe screens and Redux controls"]
        integrated["Integrate the recipe workflow"]
        scope --> contract
        contract --> back & front
        back & front --> integrated
    end
    subgraph delivery["Verification and planned delivery"]
        direction LR
        verify["Run unit, migration and<br/>two-account browser tests"]
        fixes["Fix defects"]
        demo["Nov 26 milestone<br/>Freeze the demo and slides"]
        finalWork["Verify clean setup, finish the<br/>report and record the demo"]
        submit["Dec 6 milestone<br/>Submit final project"]
        verify -->|"failure"| fixes
        fixes -->|"retest"| verify
        verify -->|"pass"| demo
        demo --> finalWork --> submit
    end
    engineering --> delivery
    classDef milestone fill:#edf4eb,stroke:#5c8057,color:#18351f
    class demo,submit milestone
